{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.CyclotomicDimensionSynthesisAllDepths","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CyclotomicDimensionSynthesisAllDepths","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Infra.BorelRank"],"declarations":2,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CyclotomicDimensionSynthesisAllDepths.dimensionSynthesisHolds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CyclotomicDimensionSynthesisAllDepths.dimensionSynthesisHolds","kind":"def","line":24,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CyclotomicDimensionSynthesisAllDepths.lean#L24-L36","doc":"The all-depths dimension-synthesis claim\n(`prop:cyclotomic-dimension-synthesis-all-depths`), as a **predicate** on the\nactual dimension at depth `n` over `ℚ(ζ_K)` (prime `K`): it equals the\nparity-cased prediction.\n\nNamed (§3b), not asserted: the previous\n`dimension_synthesis_all_depths … : predictedDim n K = (if …) := rfl`\nunfolded the definition under three unused hypotheses (its own docstring\nread \"consistent with itself\"). Substantive content — Bloch–Suslin at\n`n = 2`, Beilinson-conditional at `n ≥ 3` — is upstream/open, so this names\nthe claim rather than proving it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.CyclotomicDimensionSynthesisAllDepths.predictedDim","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.CyclotomicDimensionSynthesisAllDepths.predictedDim","kind":"def","line":16,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/CyclotomicDimensionSynthesisAllDepths.lean#L16-L22","doc":"Predicted dimension at depth `n` over `ℚ(ζ_K)` for prime `K`:\n\nn odd:  `(K - 3) / 2`\nn even: `(K - 1) / 2`\n","signatureChunk":0}]}